    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nBOARD OF INVESTMENT OF SRI LANKA(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 36 OF 2009\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 15th July, 2009]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 1.50Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of July 17, 2009\n\n1Board of Investment of Sri Lanka (Amendment)Act, No. 36 of 2009\n\n2\u2014PL 003892\u20144,240 (05/2009)\n\n[Certified on 15th July, 2009]\n\nL. D. \u2014O. 13/2008.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE BOARD OF INVESTMENT OF SRI LANKA LAW,NO. 4 OF 1978\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Board of Investment ofSri Lanka (Amendment) Act, No. 36 of 2009.\n\n2.Schedule B to the Board of Investment of Sri LankaLaw, No. 4 of 1978 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d), is hereby amended by the insertion, immediatelyafter the item \u201cThe National Film Corporation of Sri Lanka Act,No. 47 of 1971\u201d, of the following new item :\u2014\n\n\u201cThe Inland Revenue Act, No. 10 of 2006.\u201d\n\n3.The amendment made in Schedule B to the principalenactment by section 2 shall for all purposes be deemed tohave come into force on March 31, 2006, being the date onwhich the Inland Revenue Act, No. 10 of 2006 came intoforce.\n\n4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment ofSchedule B tothe principalenactment.\n\nAmendment toSchedule B to bedeemed to havecome in to forceon the date ofcommencementof the InlandRevenue Act.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseof inconsistency.\n\n2Board of Investment of Sri Lanka (Amendment)Act, No. 36 of 2009"
