    "chunk_size_bytes": 1506,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nBIBLIOMANIA EDUCATIONAL BOOKSFOR THE NATION FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION) ACT, No. 34 OF 2009\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 26th June, 2009]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of June 26, 2009\n\n1Bibliomania Educational Books for the NationFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. 34 of 2009\n\n[Certified on 26th June, 2009]\n\nL. D. \u2014O. INC 10/2005\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE BIBLIOMANIA EDUCATIONALBOOKS FOR THE NATION FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an association called and known as the\u201cBibliomania Educational Books for the Nation Foundation\u201dhas heretofore been formed at Colombo, for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out all objects and matters connectedwith the said association, according to the rules agreed to byits members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Bibliomania EducationalBooks for the Nation Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. 34 of 2009."
  },
  {
