    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nFINANCE (AMENDMENT)ACT, NO. 18 OF 2009\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 31st March, 2009]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of April 03, 2009\n\n1Finance (Amendment) Act, No. 18 of 2009\n\n2\u2014PL 003769\u2014 4,250 (03/2009)\n\nShort title.\n\n\u201cAny personorpartnership todeductconstructionIndustryGuaranteeFund Levy.\n\n[Certified on 31st March, 2009]\n\nL.D.\u2013O. 54/2008.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FINANCE ACT, NO. 5 OF 2005\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Finance (Amendment)Act, No. 18 of 2009.\n\n2.The Finance Act No. 5 of 2005 (hereinafter referredto as \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended in section13 of Part III of that Act, (Construction Industry GuaranteeFund Levy) by the Substitution for the word \u201cthe total costwhich shall be payable by each contractor or sub-contractor\u201d,of the words \u201cthe total contract value which shall be payableto each contractor or sub-contractor\u201d.\n\n3.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 13 of the principal enactment andshall have effect as section 13A of that enactment :-"
  },
