    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nSIR JOHN KOTELAWALA DEFENCEACADEMY (AMENDMENT)ACT, NO. 50 OF 2007\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 23rd October, 2007]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of October 26, 2007\n\nSir John Kotelawala Defence Academy(Amendment) Act, No. 50 of 20071\n\n[Certified on 23rd October, 2007]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 53/2006.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE SIR JOHN KOTELAWALA DEFENCEACADEMY ACT, NO. 68 OF 1981\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sir John KotelawalaDefence Academy (Amendment) Act, No. 50 of 2007.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Sir John Kotelawala DefenceAcademy Act, No. 68 of 1981 (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended by therepeal of subsection (1) of that section and the substitutiontherefor of the following subsection:\u2014\n\n\u201c(1) There shall be established a University whichshall be called the \u201cGeneral Sir John KotelawalaDefence University\u201d(hereinafter referred to as the\u201cthe University\u201d).\u201d\n\n3.(1) In the principal enactment and in any otherwritten law wherever the words \u201c Sir John KotelawalaDefence Academy\u201d occur, there shall be substituted thewords \u201cGeneral Sir John Kotelawala, Defence University\u201d.\n\n(2) Every reference to the \u201cSir John Kotelawala DefenceAcademy\u201d in any notice, notification, contract,communication or other document shall be read andconstrued as a reference to the \u201c General Sir JohnKotelawala, Defence University\u201d."
  },
