    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nREGIONAL INFRASTRUCTUREDEVELOPMENT LEVY (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 47 OF 2007\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 15th October, 2007]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of October 19, 2007\n\nRegional Infrastructure Development Levy(Amendment) Act, No. 47 of 20071\n\n2\u2014PL002383-4,350 (08/2007)\n\n[Certified on 15th October, 2007]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 37/2007\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE REGIONAL INFRASTRUCTURE DEVELOPMENTLEVY ACT, NO. 51 OF 2006\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Regional InfrastructureDevelopment Levy (Amendment) Act, No. 47 of 2007.\n\n2. Section 2 of the Regional Infrastructure DevelopmentLevy Act, No. 51of 2006 is hereby amended, by thesubstitution for the words \u201c at the rate of two and halfper centum\u201d of the words \u201cat the rate of two and half percentum in respect of a motor vehicle of a cylinder capacitynot exceeding 1600, five per centum in respect of a motorvehicle of a cylinder capacity between 1600 and 2000 andseven and half per centum in respect of a motor vehicle of acylinder capacity exceeding 2000\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of theRegionalInfrastructureDevelopmentLevy Act, No. 51of 2006.\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 befor 15th December each year in respect of the year following."
